OL,3,ARaye wins the Mercury Prize with This
OL,4,AMusic May Contain Hope
OL,5,
OL,6,FRaye has won the 2026 Mercury Prize for
OL,7,Fher show-stopping second album This
OL,8,FMusic May Contain Hope.
OL,10,FA pop record sprinkled with golden age
OL,11,FHollywood glamour, it beat the likes of
OL,12,FSir Paul McCartney, Olivia Dean and
OL,13,FJade to scoop the #25,000 prize.
OL,15,F"I couldn't tell you how grateful I am
OL,16,Fto be holding this," said Raye,
OL,17,Fclutching her trophy at Newcastle's
OL,18,FUtilita Arena. "I'm shaking, I'm
OL,19,Fjet-lagged, I'm tired. It's all
OL,20,Fblurry."
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
